sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant FE as React frontend
  participant API as Flask API
  participant ENG as Recommendation engine
  participant DB as SQLite

  U->>FE: Open vehicle on dashboard
  FE->>API: GET /vehicles/{id}/next-service
  API->>DB: SELECT user_vehicle (trim_id, current_mileage)
  DB-->>API: vehicle row
  API->>DB: SELECT schedule_rules WHERE trim_id = ?
  DB-->>API: interval_miles per service_type
  API->>DB: SELECT latest service_record per service_type
  DB-->>API: last mileage per service_type (or none)
  API->>ENG: current_mileage, rules, last services
  loop each service_type with a rule
    ENG->>ENG: due_mileage = (last mileage or 0) + interval_miles
    ENG->>ENG: miles_left = due_mileage - current_mileage
    ENG->>ENG: status label (rules open in issue 36)
  end
  ENG-->>API: next services with due_mileage, miles_left, label
  API-->>FE: 200 JSON list
  FE-->>U: Show next services, soonest first, alert if miles_left at most 500
